# Sewing some African fun!

Was feeling a little creative today and decided to gather some African fabrics and sew some pants and shorts for the family. If only there was more time, i would do this a whole lot more often. I enjoy it most when the house is quiet, the coffee is on and my overlocker stays threaded :) [![DSC02329](/media/2013/09/DSC02329.jpg)](/sewing-some-fun/dsc02329/)                               [![Sewing some fun!](/media/2013/09/DSC02331.jpg)](/sewing-some-fun/dsc02331/) Sewing some fun! [![DSC02330](/media/2013/09/DSC02330.jpg)](/sewing-some-fun/dsc02330/)
